    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Leonids"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Leonids is a new professional ensemble under the direction of Artistic Director Erick Lichte. The ensemble serves as the professional headline choir for Chor Leoni’s annual Big Roar Choral Festival and as an educational, inspirational, and aspirational force for this festival and beyond.\nIn addition to their active solo careers, these extraordinary singers have sung with Chanticleer, Conspirare, Trinity Church Wall Street, Santa Fe Desert Chorale, Clarion Choir, TENET, Skylark, Phoenix Chorale, ANÚNA, and more.\nLike the spectacular meteor showers after which they are named, The Leonids come together to rehearse, record, perform and enrich the experience of the Big Roar festival participants."
      }
    ],
